cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HBFSim in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "HBFSim: a causal simulator for HBM + high-bandwidth flash memory systems under AI workloads"
authors:
  - name: "The HBFSim contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FlashLab-MBZUAI/HBFSim"
abstract: >-
  HBFSim models timing, capacity, placement, data movement, flash translation,
  garbage collection and wear for memory systems built from HBM, high-bandwidth
  flash (HBF, OCP HBF v0.7.0) and external backing devices, driven by traces or
  by explicit transaction DAGs from LLM-serving frontends. Every result carries
  its source, configuration, executable and workload identity.
keywords:
  - high-bandwidth flash
  - HBF
  - HBM
  - memory systems
  - simulation
  - flash translation layer
  - LLM serving
